      "statement": "The tasks router's PATCH /tasks/{task_id} updates task fields in one call but refuses status changes (400) - status is a lifecycle transition owned by a single code path, POST /tasks/{task_id}/move - and the tasks router guards query parameters (board, status, assignee, priority, search, repo) with isinstance string checks so non-string task fields never break grill/conflict status handling.",
