    {
      "id": "claim_b4ab1ab720c34a759135867a256fde07",
      "statement": "New task lifecycle endpoints extend the operator surface: POST /tasks/{task_id}/split decomposes a multi-repo triage task into per-repo todo tasks, POST /tasks/{task_id}/recover routes a failure-exhausted blocked task back to the orchestrator with optional operator guidance, and POST/PUT /tasks/{task_id}/report-bug reports an internal Zero Factory defect to the upstream GitHub issue tracker (auto-creating the issue when the auto_create_github_issues setting is enabled).",
